        "description": {
          "text": "Added intravenous push (IV push) as a new method of administration for the 800 mg maintenance dose",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "TROGARZO is administered intravenously (IV) as a single loading dose of 2,000 mg followed by a maintenance dose of 800 mg every 2 weeks after dilution in 250 mL of 0.9% Sodium Chloride Injection, USP. The TROGARZO maintenance dose can also be administered as an undiluted intravenous push over 30 seconds. (2.1)",
